Bold7 Camera
============

This program is a modified version of BenOS Camera, written by Rudi Timmermans
(https://github.com/ruditimmermans/BenOSCamera), taken at the tag v3.6, commit
3f0d633d672506ba8e81979b6b448179780ba97c. The whole history and authorship of the original
are kept in this repository.

Like the original, it is free software under the GNU General Public License, version 3
(LICENSE). It comes with no warranty.

I, Arthur Michon (codexofc on GitHub), changed it from 17 November 2026 for Bold7, a BlackBerry
OS 7.1 interface for the Zinwa Q25 under LineageOS 24 (Android 17). Each change is a commit of its
own after v3.6 (git log v3.6..):

- the package is dev.bold7.camera.benos and Android's label is "Camera", so that it installs
  beside the original BenOS Camera without replacing it;
- no network request: the update check against api.github.com, at each start and from the
  settings, is removed with the INTERNET permission;
